{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgkdYG5B48wUD3sSh45eu","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**What I decided:** I'd open a trading account at פסגות and buy \"ילין לפידות מחקה S&P 500 (4D)\". The page says with 10,000 ₪ now and 500 ₪ a month for 10 years I'd end up with about **86,492 ₪**, \"אחרי דמי ניהול ומס, בכסף של היום\". I'm fairly sure. What decided it: the page puts \"הזול ★\" right on that pair, and פסגות is a name I know. I'd go with that.\n\nThe 86,492 is the page's example with 10,000 ₪ up front, not my 30,000. I didn't touch the \"סכום היום\" field, so I don't know my own number. It should be more.\n\n**How it went:**\n- **Screen 1:** The big heading \"איפה ואיך הכי זול להשקיע במדד\" was exactly my question. S&P 500 was already picked. Then the fields: 10,000, 500, 10 years, 7%. Under them, 70,000 ₪ \"הפקדתם\", then 86,492 in a box marked \"הבחירה שלכם · הזול\". Next to it a second option at 86,449, \"−43 ₪\". That's tiny, so I didn't care.\n- **Screen 2:** At the top was a coloured bar with a legend: עמלות, דמי משמרת, דמי ניהול, מס. I didn't read it. Right side: פסגות, \"1,057 ₪\" for the account over 10 years. Left side: the fund, with \"דמי ניהול 0% … 0.02% נאמן\".\n- **Screens 3–4:** The account list went down. לאומי 83,396, הבינלאומי, מזרחי, הפועלים 81,471, then down to the 63,000s. Each one had a \"לא בחשבון\" line I didn't read. The fund list on the left got scarier going down: −447, −1,268, −4,492, and then English iShares and Vanguard funds with \"אין מחיר כאן\". Skipped those.\n- **Screen 5:** One fund showed \"בין +2,212 ל־−23,766\". A range like that with a minus scares me right off. Then a block of text under \"למה חלק מהקרנות בלי מחיר\". Skipped it.\n- **Screen 6:** A chart with coloured lines. The labels sit right on the lines, so I didn't need the legend. Under it a small table: 12 years instead of 10 gives \"19,116 ₪ יותר\", and 600 a month instead of 500 gives 14,474 more. That made sense to me: put in a bit more each month.\n- **Screen 7:** Bars about the dollar and \"נטרול מט\"ח\" for each year. Lost me, bored. I stopped there and didn't open screens 8–10.\n\n**Words I didn't get:** נאמן, דמי משמרת, 4D / 4A, צוברת, מחלקת דיבידנד, עסקת החלף, מנוטרלת מט\"ח, \"מס גם על שינוי המטבע\", \"חשיפה לדולר\", \"כמה דרכים יחד\", W-8BEN, UCITS, \"לא בחשבון\".\n\n**What I'd change:**\n- The example starts at 10,000. Ask for my amount first.\n- Too many coloured tags on every fund; I can't tell them apart.\n- The second half (dollar, נטרול) is a lecture. Most people won't get that far.\n- I'm not sure the \"−43\" and \"−447\" next to funds are shekels lost against my pick. That's how I read them."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3696,"cache_read_input_tokens":13899,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3696},"output_tokens":7,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"755c0478-f679-44d9-b18a-5d11d42f548c","uuid":"8bcb08b4-ca93-4280-ab3a-10f66fe34d78","timestamp":"2026-11-05T23:14:49.507Z","request_id":"req_011CgkdYFtX3xfyW3KHzg2gK"}
